e-outpacing-western-rivals-from-evs-to-robot-vacuums/a-79646187--a8751d31a3ff.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-chinese-tech-brands-are-outpacing-western-rivals-from-evs-to-robot-vacuums/a-79646187?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From action cameras and smartphones to EVs and robot vacuums, Chinese brands are gaining ground worldwide despite privacy and security concerns. What's driving their rise, and can European rivals keep up?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Manchester City, the UAE and the UK's OM in a political tangle</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0fc233ab1f1de1f623faf0d4a3cd5917c0f68c5c011d3c86c220837b88eb0fee</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:34:21Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T08:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/manchester-city-the-uae-and-the-uk-s-om-in-a-political-tangle/a-79664729--11ae1f17a0ea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/manchester-city-the-uae-and-the-uk-s-om-in-a-political-tangle/a-79664729?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nearly 20 years after arriving in England, Manchester City's UAE owners could exit amid cheating charges. That would pose a challenge for a city — and prime minister — closely tied to Abu Dhabi.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea, China open border bridge after 12-year delay</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cab6001636a830c9a6708d0bd5bd3aee621ddbf993d71cb4a274e620e399be86</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:34:24Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T08:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-china-open-border-bridge-after-12-year-delay/a-79666112--b02034e8a849.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-china-open-border-bridge-after-12-year-delay/a-79666112?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Twelve years after it was constructed, the New Yalu River Bridge between China and North Korea is finally operational. It is the latest sign of warming ties between the two nations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU summit to focus on China, Ukraine and bloc budget</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:357487a6812e48c137af1a1b309ae5bf5707262acfdf40fd897d9c595d095429</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:34:27Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T06:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-summit-to-focus-on-china-ukraine-and-bloc-budget/a-79665338--d6856904c849.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-summit-to-focus-on-china-ukraine-and-bloc-budget/a-79665338?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">EU leaders meeting in Brussels will examine measures to curb the bloc's huge trade deficit with China. But they will also be looking to further agreement on the next EU budget ahead of some major elections next year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India urges Russia, Ukraine to protect Black Sea shipping</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:15ee775a6702e733ca7f6b9ef40428beac8e47293dcec5e28b7acbe464320624</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T04:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-urges-russia-ukraine-to-protect-black-sea-shipping/a-79662826--4fbe6c552799.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-urges-russia-ukraine-to-protect-black-sea-shipping/a-79662826?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New Delhi wants Moscow and Kyiv to ensure safe commercial shipping in the Black Sea amid attacks that put Indian seafarers at risk.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil to shorten workweek in win for Lula ahead of runoff</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:835cb1bfa30a8cff579a491781de224da3433ca138c3815af07d77b9111f69d9</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T03:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-to-shorten-workweek-in-win-for-lula-ahead-of-runoff/a-79664991--16b1f65463be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-to-shorten-workweek-in-win-for-lula-ahead-of-runoff/a-79664991?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Brazil's Senate approved cutting the workweek from 44 to 40 hours. The move could give President Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva an edge over his opponent, Flavio Bolsonaro, ahead of the October 25 runoff.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea says it tested cruise missiles to be launched from sub</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3bc5e0aa2639468e2eae7371cc46edb0c5e5ec1cace97544b984035bb90ae663</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T23:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-says-it-tested-cruise-missiles-to-be-launched-from-sub/a-79664436--051a0d5a1bc3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-says-it-tested-cruise-missiles-to-be-launched-from-sub/a-79664436?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">North Korean state media said the military test-fired cruise missiles designed to be launched from submarines. Pyongyang has ramped up weapons launches in recent weeks.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine says Musk's SpaceX limits Kyiv's Starlink access</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5219f734de26f9bf9eb520f2d4a723152a4298afefe490c077deed46a0fccd99</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T18:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-says-musk-s-spacex-limits-kyiv-s-starlink-access/a-79658015--d9d4086f4f7a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-says-musk-s-spacex-limits-kyiv-s-starlink-access/a-79658015?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukraine accused SpaceX of restricting use of its Starlink system, impacting Kyiv's ability to control its drones as Russian attacks continue unabated. President Zelenskyy has asked Elon Musk to "switch" it back on.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nord Stream trial opens in Germany, defense seeks dismissal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a656b022db6fccb99d7f675649a091b7b07a30e2bd3164d4bf5988c278db6ae5</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T18:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-trial-opens-in-germany-defense-seeks-dismissal/a-79662942--840b7e9fd757.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-trial-opens-in-germany-defense-seeks-dismissal/a-79662942?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Serhii Kuznietsov is accused of attacking civilian infrastructure in the 2022 sabotage of the Russian gas pipeline to Germany. His lawyers called Nord Stream a military target, and said their client is sworn to secrecy.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How Trump's diesel deal with Russia will impact the United States and Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1e99c815c8d5b3aee64d326982e06df3c00e6db55083e38aa34ccc5361a00261</id><updated>2026-10-15T13:32:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T17:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia-will-impact-the-united-states-and-ukraine/a-79658596--f95bfc6ecbf1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia-will-impact-the-united-states-and-ukraine/a-79658596?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Trump's diesel deal with Russia has alarmed Ukraine and its allies. What is he hoping to achieve at home, and what does the deal mean for Kyiv and Moscow?</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
